  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A common issue that happens with a lot of groups and popular instances is adding priority queue to users. However, you dont always want to add it to them permanently. So you have to go back and remove them from the group after the event. \n\nPlease add a role option to be temporary so that after the time period expires the role is removed from the member.",
